    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d331">

                <pb facs="0349" n="343" sameAs="frus:frus1894app1/pg343"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Braida to Mr.
                            Uhl.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >United States Consulate</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">San, Juan
                                del Norte</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1894-09-25"><hi rendition="#italic">September 25,
                        1894</hi></date>. (Received October 20.)</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to transmit to you an
                    affidavit filed at the office of the consular agency at Bluefields by Mr. N. L.
                    Latson, purser of the American steamship <hi rendition="#italic">Yulu.</hi></p>
                <pb facs="0350" n="344" xml:id="pg344"/>
                <p>The facts mentioned therein have previously been stated to me by other persons,
                    and have been confidentially reported to the Hon. Lewis Baker.</p>
                <p>I have, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">S. C. Braida.</hi></signed></closer>


                <xi:include href="d331-a1.xml" xpointer="d331-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
